    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Memoir of Halldór Laxness was published in Iceland from 2003. It is the memoir of novelist and Nobel Laureate, Halldór Laxnessf> and is in three volumes:",
